	<content contentuid="h553b4ae44d8046b8a1fb255239ed0de139a9" version="1">Azer</content> <!-- The Name of the custom race. Regenerate this handle before releasing the mod! -->
	<content contentuid="h0360395803fa45efa3671816759c6038efag" version="1">Denizens of the elemental plane of fire, the Azer are forged bodies out of primordial steel. They exist for centuries, creating communities among themselves and revering the art of blacksmithing above all else. You are one of the rare Azer to find their way out to the material planes; what you seek of these lands is up to you.</content> <!-- The Description of the custom race. Regenerate this handle before releasing the mod! -->
	
