	<content contentuid="h489922daa4f64d35bf4671b212e015749b27" version="1">Fireblood</content>
	<content contentuid="heed604064c8949dc8760bfae4a3867753642" version="1">Cleanse your blood by bringing yourself to a boil. Your body erupts in flames, removing Poison and igniting you.</content>
